OL,3,GNEWSA'I used to weigh 47 stone - now
OL,4,AI'm a bodybuilder'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who lost 30 stone (190.5kg) as
OL,7,Fpart of a lifestyle overhaul will
OL,8,Fcompete in his first bodybuilding
OL,9,Fcompetition later this month.
OL,11,FAt 25 years old, Jack Ako weighed 47
OL,12,Fstone (298kg) when he decided to
OL,13,Fundergo gastric bypass surgery and
OL,14,Fembark on a health and fitness journey.
OL,16,FNow a qualified personal trainer, the
OL,17,F29-year-old from Wakefield said his
OL,18,F"mindset is totally different" and he
OL,19,Fhas found "a fire and passion to help
OL,20,Fpeople", especially the younger
OL,21,Fgeneration.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
