OL,3,GNEWSA'I used to weigh 47 stone - now
OL,4,AI'm a bodybuilder'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was the big kid, then the big
OL,7,Fteenager and the extremely big adult.
OL,8,FMaybe knowledge could have changed that
OL,9,Ffor me," he said.
